"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மிழப்","tr":"miḻap"}]},{"text":"பதுவே","tr":"patuvē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பது","tr":"patu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"சிறுவெண்","parts":[{"text":"சிறுவெண்","lemma":"சிறுவெண்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காக்கைச்","parts":[{"text":"காக்கைச்","lemma":"காக்கைச்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"செவ்வாய்ப்","parts":[{"text":"செவ்வாய்ப்","lemma":"செவ்வாய்ப்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெருந்தோ","parts":[{"text":"பெருந்தோ","lemma":"பெருந்தோ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"டெறிதிரைத்","parts":[{"text":"டெறிதிரைத்","lemma":"டெறிதிரைத்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"திவலை","parts":[{"text":"திவலை","lemma":"திவலை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யீர்ம்புற","parts":[{"text":"யீர்ம்புற","lemma":"யீர்ம்புற","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நனைப்பப்","parts":[{"text":"நனைப்பப்","lemma":"நனைப்பப்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"பனிபுலந்","parts":[{"text":"பனிபுலந்","lemma":"பனிபுலந்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"துறையும்","parts":[{"text":"துறையும்","lemma":"துறையும்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பல்பூங்","parts":[{"text":"பல்பூங்","lemma":"பல்பூங்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கானல்","parts":[{"text":"கானல்","lemma":"கானல்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"விரிநீர்","parts":[{"text":"விரி","lemma":"விரிதல்","gloss":"expanding/vast"},{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"vast water"},{"surface":"சேர்ப்பன்","parts":[{"text":"சேர்ப்பன்","lemma":"சேர்ப்பன்","gloss":"lord of the maritime tract"}],"gloss":"lord of the shore"},{"surface":"நீப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"நீப்பு","lemma":"நீப்பு","gloss":"leaving/abandoning"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"if"}],"gloss":"if [he] leaves"},{"surface":"ஒரு","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one/unique"}],"gloss":"one/unique"},{"surface":"நம்","parts":[{"text":"நம்","lemma":"நம்","gloss":"our"}],"gloss":"our"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னுயி","parts":[{"text":"இன்னுயி","lemma":"இன்னுயி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ரல்லது","parts":[{"text":"ரல்லது","lemma":"ரல்லது","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பிறிதொன்","parts":[{"text":"பிறிதொன்","lemma":"பிறிதொன்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"றெவனோ","parts":[{"text":"றெவனோ","lemma":"றெவனோ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நாமிழப்","parts":[{"text":"நாமிழப்","lemma":"நாமிழப்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பதுவே","parts":[{"text":"பதுவே","lemma":"பதுவே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Small white water-crows with red mouths, their large flock / as the spray of the dashing waves wets their wet backs, / disliking the cold, dwell in the seaside grove of many flowers. / The lord of the vast water shore, if he leaves, our unique / sweet life other than, another thing / what is it, O friend, that we will lose?","translation":"O friend! If the lord of the vast-water shore—where large flocks of small, white, red-beaked water-crows, disliking the cold, dwell in the seaside grove of many flowers while the spray of dashing waves wets their backs—leaves us, what is there for us to lose other than our own sweet, unique life?","modern":"சிவந்த வாயையும் சிறிய வெண்ணிற உடலையும் உடைய கடற்காகங்களின் பெரிய கூட்டம், அலைகள் வீசும் நீர்த்துளிகள் தம்முடைய ஈரமான முதுகை நனைப்பதால், குளிரை வெறுத்து, பல மலர்கள் நிறைந்த கடற்கரைச் சோலையில் தங்கும். அத்தகைய பரந்த நீர்ப்பரப்பைக் கொண்ட கடற்கரைத் தலைவன் நம்மை விட்டுப் பிரிந்தால், தோழியே! நம்முடைய ஒப்பற்ற இனிய உயிரைத் தவிர நாம் இழக்கக்கூடிய வேறு பொருள் என்ன இருக்கிறது?","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her confidante (தோழி) about the hero's impending departure or his delay in marrying her. She describes the maritime landscape (நெய்தல் திணை) where small, white, red-beaked water-crows (சிறுவெண் காக்கை) huddle together in a seaside grove to escape the cold spray of the waves. This image of the birds seeking comfort together in the grove mirrors the heroine's need for the hero's protective presence. She asks her friend what else she has to lose besides her very life if the lord of this shore abandons her. Her deep distress and total dependence on the hero's love are vividly expressed through this poignant question.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}